        "Content": "Detached, two-storey, 4 bedroomed House with Store Shed for sale. The property extends to approximately 115m on a circa 0.46-acre site. This attractive property will make a fine family home for anyone seeking a renovation project. The property has been vacant for almost 10 years and may qualify for the Vacant / Derelict Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to the relevant criteria and approval.\nLocated along a quiet rural road, approximately 1km off the R280 (Carrick on Shannon to Manorhamilton Road), the property is approximately 8km from Manorhamilton and 6.5km from Dromahair Village. \nThe property benefits from septic tank, mains water electricity.\nThe property offers excellent privacy and significant potential for those seeking a renovation project in a countryside setting.\n\nHighlights\nProperty may be eligible for Vacant / Derelict Property Refurbishment Grant\nIdeal Renovation Project\nDetached 2-storey dwelling house with storage shed\nExtends to circa 115mon a circa 0.46-acre site.\n? Roadside property in a peaceful and private setting.\n? Located only 8km from Manorhamilton and 6.5km from Dromahair Village. \n\n \n\nAccommodation\n\nSitting Room\n3.66m x 3.35m open fireplace\n\nLiving Room\n3.96m x 3.05m solid fuel stove with back boiler\n\nKitchen\n4.27m x 3.05m\n\nShower Room\n2.44m x 1.83m whb, toilet, electric shower\n\nBedroom 1\n3.05m x 2.44m\n\nBedroom 2\n3.66m x 3.35m\n\nBedroom 3\n3.35m x 3.05m\n\nBedroom 4\n3.35m x 2.13m\n\nShed\n4.27m x 3.35m\n\n\nOutside\nstore shed"
